{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2023-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1688860800, "end_date": 1689465599, "month_true_total": 367, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:50:42 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "142151146", "author": {"steamid": "76561198981636456", "personaname": "ƈɦɛɛֆʏʍօօռ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CheesyMoon/", "num_games_owned": 144, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 682, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 682, "last_played": 1689444601, "avatar": "04384357f322b2c1e665d5b9b57b5550944c2811"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game with friends.\n\nDifference between difficulties is a little to big\n\nLike the pop-ups between safe-houses about the enemies and other events\n\nLike the gun mechanics (attachments, recoil, different rarity of guns)", "timestamp_created": 1689449184, "timestamp_updated": 1689449184, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142150444", "author": {"steamid": "76561198138175642", "personaname": "Dr.Sushi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DrSushi/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 898, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 898, "last_played": 1689447842, "avatar": "9fdc73f154e1eab4ffccbde59c16811f9cc1b31b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Most of the critics here seems directed towards the developers than the game. \nI personally had a lot of fun playing this game and while usually I don't like deck building mechanics I do think this one is very simple and fun. Specials ridden are well made and the card mecha